# Ship only what the page actually fetches: 255 files, ~12.7 MB (most of it pages/).
# (Verified by recording every request a real page load makes — not by eyeballing.)
# The working directory is 1.1 GB, so deploying it unfiltered is not an option.

# Reference apps the user drops in to capture product-true frames. Never served.
Reference Projects/

# Source masters for the exports. The built .webp next to them is what ships.
assets/Scene */

