# Video / staging material dropped into assets/ for scenes not built yet. Tracked in
# git on purpose (it's source material) but never served.
#
# NOTE this file is a DENY-list, so anything new in assets/ ships by default — that is
# how an unreferenced 1 MB of video nearly reached the live site on 2026-07-29. After
# adding assets, re-derive the deploy set (record a page load's requests and diff), and
# add anything the page does not fetch here.
*.mp4
*.mov
assets/Last frameCinematic Morph Video 1.svg

# Icon + cursor masters — these are inlined in index.html now, not fetched.
assets/icon-bookmark.svg
assets/icon-comment.svg
assets/icon-react.svg
assets/Cursor Dark.svg
assets/Cursor Light.svg

# Build scripts and internal notes — keep these off a public URL.
tools/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
shots/

# Never ship the repo itself. Vercel's own CLI excludes .git implicitly, but
# tools/deploy-vercel.py walks the directory literally — without this it would upload
# the whole git store, .git/config included, to a public host. Caught 2026-07-29.
.git/
.gitignore

.claude/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Drag-and-drop copy of the runtime files (tools/ rebuilds it). Not part of a deploy.
complex-scroll-animation/
